          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) Any person who has been arrested on a violation of an ordinance of the City of Topeka may petition the Municipal Court for the expungement of such arrest record.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "9887ab6a-5c03-54e7-b402-e56b06e27704",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 784,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:1",
          "start": 166
        },
        "quote": "(b) When a petition for expungement is filed, the court shall set a date for hearing on such petition and shall cause notice of such hearing to be given to the prosecuting attorney and the arresting law enforcement agency. When a petition for expungement is filed, the official court file shall be separated from the other records of the court, and shall be disclosed only to a judge of the court and members of the court staff, the prosecuting attorney, the arresting law enforcement agency, or any other person when authorized by court order, subject to any conditions imposed by the order. The petition shall state:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "bb4bf240-d419-5701-940e-ea07c9de0208",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 816,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:2",
          "start": 785
        },
        "quote": "(1) The petitioner’s full name;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "e366a194-03d2-551d-b1ee-8238cb33d817",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 924,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:3",
          "start": 817
        },
        "quote": "(2) The full name of the petitioner at the time of arrest, if different than the petitioner’s current name;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "3f1f444e-aa18-5cee-ab12-ae2d3c6328c2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 974,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:4",
          "start": 925
        },
        "quote": "(3) The petitioner’s sex, race and date of birth;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "70795fe6-b6f3-5cdb-b42e-c01c9170b9c4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1027,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:5",
          "start": 975
        },
        "quote": "(4) The crime for which the petitioner was arrested;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "4f56e152-a376-59dd-8ed7-40fc71cf67c2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1072,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:6",
          "start": 1028
        },
        "quote": "(5) The date of the petitioner’s arrest; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "72ce3428-f974-5898-a516-a2b0267d06ce",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1130,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:7",
          "start": 1073
        },
        "quote": "(6) The identity of the arresting law enforcement agency.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "ca640930-53d5-5bd1-95f5-249bdd5f2c8f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1628,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:8",
          "start": 1131
        },
        "quote": "The Municipal Court may prescribe a fee to be charged as costs for a person petitioning for an order of expungement pursuant to this section, except that no fee shall be charged to a person who was arrested as a result of being a victim of identity theft under K.S.A. 21-4018 , prior to its repeal, or K.S.A. 21-6107 , and amendments thereto. Any person who may have relevant information about the petitioner may testify at the hearing. The court may inquire into the background of the petitioner.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "7178f3e7-af10-53d4-a437-ddd52f5b3329",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1783,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:9",
          "start": 1629
        },
        "quote": "(c) At the hearing on a petition for expungement, the court shall order the arrest record and subsequent court proceedings, if any, expunged upon finding:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "2ca4df06-2c1a-518d-b2b3-11eaeae8689f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1837,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:10",
          "start": 1784
        },
        "quote": "(1) The arrest occurred because of mistaken identity;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "8bed0a91-26b0-51df-a78b-a504db483546",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1908,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:11",
          "start": 1838
        },
        "quote": "(2) A court has found that there was no probable cause for the arrest;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "0785b91c-02a0-5c33-87ba-74f227ea40fd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1973,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:12",
          "start": 1909
        },
        "quote": "(3) The petitioner was found not guilty in court proceedings; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "053e4566-7a59-598c-8868-6baa392ab294",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2128,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:13",
          "start": 1974
        },
        "quote": "(4) The expungement would be in the best interests of justice and (i) charges have been dismissed; or (ii) no charges have been or are likely to be filed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "810e0ee3-034c-51ed-a288-c12aae638517",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2756,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:14",
          "start": 2129
        },
        "quote": "(d) When the court has ordered expungement of an arrest record and subsequent court proceedings, if any, the order shall state the information required to be stated in the petition and shall state the grounds for expungement under subsection (c) of this section. The clerk of the court shall send a certified copy of the order to the Kansas Bureau of Investigation, which shall notify the Federal Bureau of Investigation, the Secretary of Corrections and any other criminal justice agency which may have a record of the arrest. If an order of expungement is entered, the petitioner shall be treated as not having been arrested.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "cd111098-10b5-558d-ba05-bf0dec2e9bbf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2980,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:15",
          "start": 2757
        },
        "quote": "(e) If the ground for expungement is as provided in subsection (c)(4) of this section, the court shall determine whether, in the interest of public welfare, the records should be available for any of the following purposes:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "6e36c110-17fd-5964-82bf-577737b2b6f5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3349,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:16",
          "start": 2981
        },
        "quote": "(1) In any application for employment as a detective with a private detective agency, as defined by K.S.A. 75-7b01 and amendments thereto; as security personnel with a private patrol operator, as defined by K.S.A. 75-7b01 and amendments thereto; or with an institution, as defined in K.S.A. 76-12a01 and amendments thereto, of the Department for Children and Families;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "8dde6c61-523e-51e6-8663-d41856c9a0a3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3459,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:17",
          "start": 3350
        },
        "quote": "(2) In any application for admission, or for an order of reinstatement, to the practice of law in this State;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "c86443cb-9106-566e-b358-fd5bb7c69eba",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3684,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:18",
          "start": 3460
        },
        "quote": "(3) To aid in determining the petitioner’s qualifications for employment with the Kansas Lottery or for work in sensitive areas within the Kansas Lottery as deemed appropriate by the Executive Director of the Kansas Lottery;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "0240bbda-0c0b-5baf-a5f9-a661fe07791d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4060,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:19",
          "start": 3685
        },
        "quote": "(4) To aid in determining the petitioner’s qualifications for Executive Director of the Kansas Racing and Gaming Commission, for employment with the Commission or for work in sensitive areas in parimutuel racing as deemed appropriate by the Executive Director of the Commission, or to aid in determining qualifications for licensure or renewal of licensure by the Commission;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "00940434-5157-5039-8814-07295437900f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4176,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:20",
          "start": 4061
        },
        "quote": "(5) In any application for a commercial driver’s license under K.S.A. 8-2125 through 8-2142 and amendments thereto;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "dba3f953-0826-5d7e-b498-efec3359de55",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4280,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:21",
          "start": 4177
        },
        "quote": "(6) To aid in determining the petitioner’s qualifications to be an employee of the State Gaming Agency;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "ea94a860-4add-5db7-857b-1bd0bcb36680",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4460,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:22",
          "start": 4281
        },
        "quote": "(7) To aid in determining the petitioner’s qualifications to be an employee of a tribal gaming commission or to hold a license issued pursuant to a tribal-state gaming compact; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "38223a2f-fb96-5926-a6cd-85b3232573a1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4526,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:23",
          "start": 4461
        },
        "quote": "(8) In any other circumstances which the court deems appropriate.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "2facced7-0cbd-59d6-a1de-712b148a06d3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4736,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:24",
          "start": 4527
        },
        "quote": "(f) The court shall make all expunged records and related information in the court’s possession, created prior to, on and after July 1, 2011, available to the Kansas Bureau of Investigation for the purpose of:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "cf6203d0-947f-55f1-93f9-cdf902a2f302",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4898,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:25",
          "start": 4737
        },
        "quote": "(1) Completing a person’s criminal history record information within the central repository in accordance with K.S.A. 22-4701 et seq., and amendments thereto; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "5d6a5314-290d-5a70-8bc4-f66d23fa462a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5115,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:26",
          "start": 4899
        },
        "quote": "(2) Providing information or documentation to the Federal Bureau of Investigation, in connection with the national instant criminal background check system, to determine a person’s qualification to possess a firearm.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.670 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "148d016a-9973-53e1-ae44-896b37afca69",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5432,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:27",
          "start": 5116
        },
        "quote": "(g) Subject to any disclosures required under subsection (e) of this section, in any application for employment, license or other civil right or privilege, or any appearance as a witness, a person whose arrest records have been expunged as provided in this section may state that such person has never been arrested.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.670:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
